    <string name="myzel_watch">Watch</string>
    <string name="myzel_watch_intro">Myzel installs apps on your Wear OS watch over Bluetooth. Setting it up once needs “Wireless debugging” on the watch; Myzel turns it off again afterwards.</string>
    <string name="myzel_watch_howto">On the watch</string>
    <string name="myzel_watch_howto_steps">1. Settings → System → About → tap “Build number” 7 times.\n2. Developer options: turn on “ADB debugging” and “Wireless debugging”.\n3. Connect the watch to the same Wi-Fi as this phone.\n4. Wireless debugging → “Pair new device”: leave the code on screen.</string>
    <string name="myzel_watch_permission">Myzel needs the permission “Nearby devices” to find the watch and reach it over Bluetooth.</string>
